# 3. CUSTOMER AI STATE MACHINE

Buat sistem Customer AI menggunakan finite state machine (FSM).

Gunakan state yang terpisah, modular, dan mudah dikembangkan.

Minimal implementasikan state berikut:

- SPAWNING
- ENTERING
- QUEUING
- SEARCHING_TABLE
- WALKING_TO_TABLE
- SEATING
- SEATED
- WAITING_FOR_WAITER
- WAITING_FOR_ORDER
- WAITING_FOR_FOOD
- EATING
- WAITING_FOR_BILL
- LEAVING_TABLE
- WALKING_TO_EXIT
- EXITING
- COMPLETED
- ANGRY
- CANCELLED

Tidak semua state harus aktif pada Phase 05 apabila order dan billing system belum tersedia.

State yang belum didukung sistem sebelumnya harus dipersiapkan secara modular, bukan dipaksakan dengan fitur palsu.

### State flow

Implementasikan alur utama:

SPAWNING
↓
ENTERING
↓
QUEUING (jika perlu)
↓
SEARCHING_TABLE
↓
WALKING_TO_TABLE
↓
SEATING
↓
SEATED
↓
WAITING_FOR_WAITER
↓
WAITING_FOR_ORDER
↓
WAITING_FOR_FOOD
↓
EATING
↓
WAITING_FOR_BILL
↓
LEAVING_TABLE
↓
WALKING_TO_EXIT
↓
EXITING
↓
COMPLETED

Buat transition rules yang jelas.

Setiap state harus memiliki:

- State entry logic.
- State update logic.
- State exit logic.
- Transition validation.
- Timeout handling jika relevan.
- Cancellation handling.

Hindari state transition yang dipanggil berulang-ulang setiap frame.

